OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,13,     Fafternoon of great music including
OL,14,     Fperformances from the Bavarian
OL,15,     FRadio Symphony Orchestra and
OL,16,     Fchamber music from across Bavaria.
